{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cf25wCVA57eBTth9vXAkY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I built the todo app as `index.html` in the repo root. I tested it in headless Chromium, opened straight from the file, and it works.\n\n**What the test did:**\n- Added three todos. Typing only spaces and clicking Add did nothing.\n- Deleted the middle todo and reloaded. `one` and `three` came back from `localStorage`.\n- The saved data under `todos` has an `id` and a `createdAt` timestamp on each todo.\n- There were no page errors and no network requests.\n\n**Details:**\n- All six `data-testid` attributes are used exactly as given.\n- The Enter key also adds a todo, not just the Add button.\n- The `id` comes from the browser's built-in UUID generator, with a fallback if that isn't available.\n- If the saved data is unreadable, the app starts with an empty list instead of breaking.\n\nNothing is committed yet."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":619,"cache_read_input_tokens":39741,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":619},"output_tokens":281,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b6389489-3f15-4f8d-bccf-7031b04d6346","uuid":"fa5ccfe0-857c-435d-954b-68359d9148b8","timestamp":"2026-09-13T20:40:47.967Z","request_id":"req_011Cf25wBojAMFxGYL6aASkR"}
